; A bare `__store64` of a reference takes no share: the stored word
; names a block whose release the walk never counted. AX3071.
; Tagged `effect(unsafe)` so this golden pins AX3071 alone; AX3073's
; own primary is 1004.
(:: main Int)
;@axiom:effect(unsafe)
(fn (main)
  (let ((s "held"))
    {
      (__store64
        (__alloc 16)
        0
        (cast Int s))
      0
    }))
